  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual External Audit of DWBI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;rlig revision DWBI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the specific agreement with the Government of Kenya for support to the Data Warehouse Business Intelligence Solution, an annual external audit should be carried out. The procurement of the audit should be done by Sweden. The embassy&apos;s framework agreement will be used for the purpose.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Enligt avtalet med regeringen om st&#xf6;d till det kenyanska skatteverket f&#xf6;r upphandling av datalagringssystem, ska en &#xe5;rlig revision genomf&#xf6;ras. Upphandlingen av externrevisionen ska enligt avtalet g&#xf6;ras av Sverige. Ambassadens ramavtal f&#xf6;r revision anv&#xe4;nds f&#xf6;r &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;let.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective was to provide independent financial audits and technical reviews of contribution 51110081 Kenya Revenue Authority and Data Warehouse and Business Intelligence.</narrative>
  </description>
